+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+The health-gate read path changed in one step: `PRAGMA quick_check` was moved
+off the `SessionStart` path, FTS coherence began using the trigger-maintained
+`meta.fts_rows` counter, and the body-size invariant became a schema `CHECK`
+constraint instead of a read-time scan.
+
+| State | Store | SessionStart p50 |
+| --- | ---: | ---: |
+| Before that change | 5,000 records | No measured p50 was found in this checkout or its recorded project history. |
+| After that change | 5,000 records, 15,000 cues | **0.935471 ms** |
+
+The post-change value is measured, not estimated. It is the median of 300 hook
+process invocations from:
+
+```text
+target/release/muninn-bench perf --records 5000 \
+  --muninn /absolute/path/to/target/release/muninn --json
+```
+
+The same run reported `SessionStart` p95 1.217212 ms and p99 1.352321 ms.
+Because no pre-change revision or benchmark result is present, the isolated
+speedup cannot be calculated honestly.
